arted in a deafening roar with Chiron taking the immediate lead, followed by Morel and Bret.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Chiron completed the first lap in 3m25s, which represented an average of 71,475 km/h. He was thirty meters ahead of Morel in second place, followed by Bret, Dreyfus and Williams.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Chiron spins at the hairpin after the grandstands, loses several minutes and drops to the very rear of the field.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Morel had passed into the lead but not for long, because Bret had overtaken him by the end of the second lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":3,"text":"Williams passes Morel for second behind Bret.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":3,"text":"Cereseto and Tr\u00fctzschler were having a good battle without any clear advantage for one or the other.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":5,"text":"Before the fifth lap Dreyfus overtook Morel, who was having some sort of trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":9,"text":"While lapping a back-marker on the outside of a turn, Morel leaves the track and hits a rock; he retires.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":10,"text":"Ominously, Chiron was already up to seventh, but was still three minutes behind the leader, but had not been lapped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"Bret continued to lead with a good advantage of about 50 seconds ahead of Williams and Dreyfus.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":15,"text":"On the fifteenth lap, Bret was still in command and had increased his lead ahead of Williams and Dreyfus, while Chiron had passed Tr\u00fctzschler and was in fourth position chasing after Dreyfus.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":23,"text":"On lap 23 Bret stopped at his pit to check the valves, but soon left again. In the meantime, Williams had inherited the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":24,"text":"Bret laps in 3m05s at 79.174 km/h but must stop again.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":28,"text":"Bret, two laps down, stops at the pits and cannot restart because of a valve problem.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":29,"text":"Before the 30th lap, Chiron passed Dreyfus for second place and was now only 35 seconds behind Williams and reducing his lead by four or five seconds every lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"De Joncy, who led the 1100 cc category, broke his gearshift lever and retired from the race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":34,"text":"Chiron catches Williams and, after some wheel-to-wheel racing, retakes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"There were just seven cars left after d'Havrincourt retired his Salmson.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":47,"text":"On lap 47 he was 2m7.2s ahead of Williams, all others were already lapped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":52,"text":"On the 52nd lap, Chiron lapped Williams","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":55,"text":"Chiron stops to refuel and Williams unlaps himself; Chiron quickly makes up the lost time.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"At the 60th lap, which was after 240.420 km, Chiron was first in 3h21m25s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":65,"text":"Chiron once more stopped briefly at his pit and lost time. Williams passed Chiron in his pit and un-lapped himself again.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":69,"text":"On lap 69 Chiron had made up the time lost during his stop to refuel and lapped Williams again.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":72,"text":"Williams stopped at his pit on lap 72.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":75,"text":"Chiron wins in 4h10m43.4s; Williams is second, eight minutes later, Dreyfus third.","q":false,"c":0}]}